  "measurement_scope": "Vertex-area diagnostic on synthetic Poisson reconstructions. The committed instrument counts whole triangle area when any vertex is far; therefore these shares, ratios, and threshold-crossing gap counts are not measurements of the committed instrument and must not be used as its exact rescore.",
  "normal_agreement_cutoff_degrees": 60.0,
